# Cleaning the Workspace

To remove all generated artifacts:

```bash
rm -rf workspace
```

The next execution recreates everything automatically.

---

# Updating Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt --upgrade
```

---

# Development Workflow

Recommended workflow:

```
Analyze

↓

Plan Feature

↓

Run Task 1

↓

Review

↓

Run Task 2

↓

Review

↓

...

↓

Run Task N

↓

Review

↓

Integrate Feature
```

Running tasks independently makes debugging easier and allows interrupted executions to be resumed.

---

# Troubleshooting

## Claude session expired

Reauthenticate Claude CLI.

---

## Virtual environment not activated

Linux:

```bash
source .venv/bin/activate
```

---

## Missing dependencies

Run:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## Configuration missing

Ensure that:

```
config.json
```

exists.

---

## Workspace corruption

Delete:

```
workspace/
```

and execute the workflow again.

